      "content": "We can strategically frame it as a focused, preliminary investigation designed to rigorously test a specific, high-risk hypothesis. Emphasize the depth of the analysis for the given small set, and highlight how this pilot study will inform the design of a much larger, definitive study in the future. This reframes the current work as a valuable strategic step in a larger, ambitious research trajectory, rather than just a small outcome.",
